HNCS Daylight for Lightroom

This distribution includes downstream adaptations of public HNCS
reverse-engineering work from V-Log-Alchemy:

  V-Log-Alchemy
  https://github.com/shenmintao/V-Log-Alchemy
  Copyright Shen Min Tao and contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Modifications and downstream work include conversion of the recovered HNCS
Daylight color structures to Adobe Creative Profile LookTable form, relative Film
Tone integration for Lightroom, camera-model-unrestricted profile packaging,
documentation, and deterministic release validation.

